 "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/pull/412", "diff_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/pull/412.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/pull/412.patch", "merged_at": "2026-08-09T21:12:31Z"}, "body": "Adds a new `GotoLocationFixedwing` RPC to the action service, intended for fixed-wing aircraft.\n\nUnlike `GotoLocation`, this variant accepts a `loiter_radius_m` parameter (param3 of `MAV_CMD_DO_REPOSITION`). Positive values give a clockwise loiter, negative counter-clockwise, and 0 is ignored by the autopilot. Yaw (param4) is sent as NaN since it is not meaningful while a fixed-wing aircraft is continuously turning in a loiter.\n\nCloses mavlink/MAVSDK#2853.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/issues/412/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/issues/412/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null}}, "event": "cross-referenced"}, {"actor": {"login": "Bartok9", "id": 259807879, "node_id": "U_kgDOD3xahw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259807879?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9", "html_url": "https://github.com/Bartok9", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bartok9/received_events", "type": "U